	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "KELIKING KLJ-01304T-08R07W (LCSC C18186315) 8 ohm 0.7 W SMD speaker. Body 13 x 13 x 4.0 mm. Four 2.0 x 2.5 mm lands: the electrical pair on 11.4 mm centres at y=-4.35 mm, dummy pair at y=+4.35 mm for reflow stability. Geometry from the LCSC/EasyEDA land BUZ-SMD_4P-L13.0-W13.0-P11.4-BL (0.254 mm units) and the vendor appearance drawing. Pad 1 is + / SPK_P on +X, pad 2 is - / SPK_N on -X, matching the datasheet LEAD(+) / LEAD(-) marks. Dummy pads have no pin number so they stay out of the netlist. Rotation 0 points the electrical pair toward -Y (the analog island) and the dummy pair toward the top short edge. A + voltage on pad 1 moves the diaphragm toward the front (away from the PCB, into the lid grille). https://jlcpcb.com/partdetail/KELIKING-KLJ_01304T08R07W/C18186315")
	(tags "speaker SMD KELIKING KLJ-01304T")
